{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"ba1ab46e42e784cde98e7b69dca91399dcc7d758951f802d5da0412989293c76","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗受罚"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["米利暗和亚伦因摩西娶了一个古实的女子而批评他，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“难道耶和华只借着摩西说话吗？祂不也借着我们说话吗？”耶和华听见了这话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["其实摩西为人十分谦和，比世上任何人都谦和。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华突然对摩西、亚伦和米利暗说：“你们三人都出来到会幕去。”他们就去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华在云柱中降临，站在会幕门口呼唤亚伦和米利暗，二人就走到前面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：“你们听我说，你们中间若有先知，我耶和华必在异象中向他显现，在梦中跟他说话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但我不是这样对待我的仆人摩西，他在我家里忠信可靠，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我跟他面对面说话，清清楚楚，不用谜语，他看得见我的形象。你们怎敢批评我的仆人摩西？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华向他们发怒，然后离去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["云彩从会幕上离开的时候，米利暗身上患了麻风病，像雪一样白。亚伦见状，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["便对摩西说：“我主啊，求你不要因我们愚昧犯罪而惩罚我们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["求你不要让她像那一出母腹便半身腐烂的死胎。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["于是，摩西呼求耶和华：“上帝啊，求你医治她！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：“如果她父亲在她脸上吐唾沫，她岂不也要蒙羞七天吗？现在把她关在营外，七天后再让她回来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["于是，米利暗被关在营外七天，民众等她回营后才继续前行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他们离开哈洗录，到巴兰旷野安营。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NUM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}